  "description": "Are you looking for a trail bike that connects you with the terrain - and that also performs well on the climbs? Then we have developed the Wild Ronin Team just for you. With the new full carbon frame, the RockShox Ultimate suspension with 140 mm travel and the innovative 4-Link Swingarm rear suspension, you are ready for full all-mountain action. Thanks to the Swingarm technology developed by us, you have maximum control on the descents and the best possible traction for full climbing power on the climbs. Every component has been carefully selected and tuned for maximum off-road performance. From the wireless drivetrain and the RockShox Reverb dropper post to the Mavic Crossmax Carbon XLR wheels and the Rumble Altimate Pro carbon handlebar/stem unit.",
